OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into 'major fish
OL,4,Akill' after pollution incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA investigation is underway after "a
OL,7,Fmajor fish kill" in a County Down
OL,8,Friver, the Department for Agriculture,
OL,9,FEnvironment and Rural Affairs (Daera)
OL,10,Fhas confirmed.
OL,12,FThe pollution caused the death of brown
OL,13,Fand migratory sea trout in the Gransha,
OL,14,FBallystockart and Inler (also known as
OL,15,FEnler) Rivers.
OL,17,FGlenn McKibbin, the secretary of Inler
OL,18,FAngling Club, said about 1,000 fish
OL,19,Fwere killed in the incident and it
OL,20,F"could not have happened in a worse
OL,21,Flocation on the river or at a worse
OL,22,Ftime".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
