OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into 'major fish
OL,4,Akill' after pollution incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Environment Agency
OL,7,F(NIEA) and Daera Inland Fisheries are
OL,8,Fworking to "identify the source of the
OL,9,Fpollution and to finalise the numbers
OL,10,Fof fish killed".
